cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use citecheck-zh in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "citecheck-zh: Structural citation-reference consistency checker for Chinese manuscripts"
abstract: >-
  Offline command-line checker that parses UTF-8 Markdown/TXT manuscripts,
  detects numeric and author-year citation markers, and reports ten classes of
  structural citation/reference inconsistencies with 1-based line and column
  positions. Includes a first-appearance renumbering command.
authors:
